window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Jasmine thought her problems would end once she mastered the cursed pendant.</p> <p>Ah-ha-ha. How cute.</p> <p>When she returns to the Magical Creatures Academy after a prolonged absence, she discovers the supernatural community is at the brink of war.</p> <p>A rogue organization of paranormals wants power it shouldn’t have, leaving the magical world divided...and more dangerous than ever.</p> <p>Safety is no longer guaranteed. Not for anyone. Not anywhere.</p> <p>That doesn’t cut it for Jas and her friends. Together, they’ll join the fight.</p>"; 
